      "id": "file:core/ondemand/ondemand_pubsub_test.cc",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "ondemand_pubsub_test.cc",
      "filePath": "core/ondemand/ondemand_pubsub_test.cc",
      "summary": "OnDemand 系统综合集成测试文件(4601行)，包含 27 个测试用例(TC1-TC27)，覆盖生命周期管理、频率协商、通信恢复、多 pub 场景、动态变量变更、批量写入、发布控制、同步读取、Matched/Unmatched 回调、资源限制等全部核心功能。",
      "tags": ["test", "integration-test", "pub-sub", "dds", "gtest"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "使用 fork() 创建子进程模拟 pub/sub 节点，通过文件报告机制(childReport)收集子进程结果。仅在 Linux 平台编译(__linux__ 宏保护)。"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:core/ondemand/readme.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "readme.md",
      "filePath": "core/ondemand/readme.md",
      "summary": "OnDemand 模块开发笔记，记录已知 TODO 和 bug(线程池退出问题)，以及 VarStore Arena 内存占用分析(500k 变量约 600MB)，指出 64B header 对小变量的 32 倍开销、双缓冲 2x 数据、shared_ptr<Define> 堆分配等优化方向。",
      "tags": ["documentation", "memory-analysis", "performance", "development-notes"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:core/ondemand/variable_store.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "variable_store.h",
      "filePath": "core/ondemand/variable_store.h",
      "summary": "高性能无锁变量存储实现，使用 Seqlock + 双缓冲机制实现线程安全的读写分离。64 字节对齐的 Slot 结构避免 false sharing，支持批量注册/写入、动态扩容、脏队列追踪变更变量，读端提供零拷贝 ScopedPtr 访问。",
      "tags": ["header", "lock-free", "data-structure", "performance", "concurrency"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Seqlock 内存序协议：写开始 fetch_add(relaxed)+fence(release)，写结束 fetch_add(release)，读端 acquire-load 配对。使用 aligned_alloc(64) 保证 arena 对齐。"
    },
